OL,3,ADaniel Thomas pleads not guilty after
OL,4,Adinghy slashed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-migrant activist Daniel Thomas has
OL,7,Fappeared before magistrates charged
OL,8,Fwith criminal damage.
OL,10,FThe 37-year-old, known to his
OL,11,Fsupporters as Danny Tommo, was arrested
OL,12,Fafter a video appeared to show him
OL,13,Fslashing at a dinghy in the English
OL,14,FChannel with an emergency responder on
OL,15,Fboard.
OL,17,FThomas, who appeared at Basingstoke
OL,18,FMagistrates' Court via videolink, is
OL,19,Falso charged with failing to disclose
OL,20,Fthe PIN to his phone.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
