OL,3,ADaniel Thomas pleads not guilty after
OL,4,Adinghy slashed
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe pleaded not guilty to both charges
OL,7,Fand will appear at Portsmouth Crown
OL,8,FCourt on 29th September.
